From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wai Chung <hello@ternii.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] ggml-metal: optional decode fusions for
 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next (default off)

GGML_METAL_OPT_GDNPREP: gated-delta-net input preparation folded into the
GDN kernel for single-token decode. GGML_METAL_OPT_NGATED: RMS_NORM * w *
gate(z) in one dispatch. Planned in graph_optimize; no-op unless the env
flags are set.
---
